{"3004280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Magic: Rise of Magic", "steam_appid": 3004280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>World of Magic: Rise of Magic is an open-world action RPG set in a Medieval Punk fantasy world, where combat, magic, and world simulation systems dynamically interact to create unpredictable gameplay outcomes. Players take on the role of a mage in a living world where spell combinations, enemy adaptation, and narrative choices continuously reshape both combat and the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features real-time spell fusion, adaptive enemy AI that evolves based on player behaviour, and a reactive world-state system where decisions have long-term consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Adaptive Enemy &amp; NPC AI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies analyze player combat behaviour over time and adapt their strategies accordingly, prioritizing specific elemental counters and adjusting tactics during prolonged encounters. NPCs also react to world events and player interactions, creating a living ecosystem of evolving behaviour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolutionary Magic Combat System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around a modular magic system where spells can be dynamically combined and modified during battle. Players can infuse elemental and physical modifiers into spells in real time, creating layered interactions that bypass traditional counters and generate emergent combat outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative World</strong><br><br>Player choices directly influence both the narrative direction and the state of the world. Relationships with NPCs evolve over time based on decisions made throughout the game, affecting dialogue options, interactions, and how characters perceive the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain choices lead to permanent consequences, altering future events and reshaping parts of the world as the story progresses.<br></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Character Progression</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players develop their mage through learning and mastering new spells, combining them in real time, and infusing elemental properties dynamically during combat. Beyond combat abilities, the character evolves through experience, shaping personality traits that influence dialogue options, available responses, and how the world reacts to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Punk Setting  </strong>  <br> The world blends medieval fantasy with magically powered electronics, creating a distinct “Medieval Punk” atmosphere. Set in the year 2037, the rise of magic reshaped society into a brutal medieval era.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is descending into chaos as kingdoms collapse under internal conflict and rising dark magic. Cities worship the most powerful mages while rural regions are left to survive against growing monster threats. As war spreads across the land and forbidden forces begin to reshape reality, the player is forced to navigate a collapsing world while uncovering a deeper, more dangerous threat emerging behind the conflict.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>World of Magic: Rise of Magic is an open-world action RPG set in a Medieval Punk fantasy world, where combat, magic, and world simulation systems dynamically interact to create unpredictable gameplay outcomes. Players take on the role of a mage in a living world where spell combinations, enemy adaptation, and narrative choices continuously reshape both combat and the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features real-time spell fusion, adaptive enemy AI that evolves based on player behaviour, and a reactive world-state system where decisions have long-term consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Adaptive Enemy &amp; NPC AI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies analyze player combat behaviour over time and adapt their strategies accordingly, prioritizing specific elemental counters and adjusting tactics during prolonged encounters. NPCs also react to world events and player interactions, creating a living ecosystem of evolving behaviour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolutionary Magic Combat System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around a modular magic system where spells can be dynamically combined and modified during battle. Players can infuse elemental and physical modifiers into spells in real time, creating layered interactions that bypass traditional counters and generate emergent combat outcomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative World</strong><br><br>Player choices directly influence both the narrative direction and the state of the world. Relationships with NPCs evolve over time based on decisions made throughout the game, affecting dialogue options, interactions, and how characters perceive the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain choices lead to permanent consequences, altering future events and reshaping parts of the world as the story progresses.<br></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Character Progression</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players develop their mage through learning and mastering new spells, combining them in real time, and infusing elemental properties dynamically during combat. Beyond combat abilities, the character evolves through experience, shaping personality traits that influence dialogue options, available responses, and how the world reacts to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Punk Setting  </strong>  <br> The world blends medieval fantasy with magically powered electronics, creating a distinct “Medieval Punk” atmosphere. Set in the year 2037, the rise of magic reshaped society into a brutal medieval era.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is descending into chaos as kingdoms collapse under internal conflict and rising dark magic. Cities worship the most powerful mages while rural regions are left to survive against growing monster threats. As war spreads across the land and forbidden forces begin to reshape reality, the player is forced to navigate a collapsing world while uncovering a deeper, more dangerous threat emerging behind the conflict.</p>", "short_description": "An open-world Medieval Punk Action RPG. Combine and modify spells in real time while enemies adapt to your combat tactics. Choices shape a living fantasy world filled with cities, monsters, and escalating conflict.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, S